enshot-2560x1440-B.png", "id": "518199367649623", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035315_518199370982956_3030587656090885372_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j75ldcalmRIQ7kNvwEOcbp7&_nc_oc=AdlgFfaisKfe6Rsz0GMCBnEHTk1jg7JRZfNSVSn_xYROWhvCdu--gEpI24fEGX84610&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afzp4-h89Ix3GfE02gUflTJ295_3h3okOofe8YYkcqHX7A&oe=69BE9D8D"}, {"file_name": "SA-LS-Launch-Meta-Screenshot-2560x1440-C.png", "id": "905966224922640", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974900_905966228255973_5130841505886610815_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mmf731DPBKAQ7kNvwH8lx7F&_nc_oc=Adl3fjXuKqDkHDy1rD1BAPuHVPQ4l_XBCgr4QvWZeXx8gdlimeyUUb4qD0wdVEgZTEU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxaNxoGBnA8iSgnY8v0mDfxhCxs0O28p_B871vxkMSy9w&oe=69BEA44B"}, {"file_name": "SA-LS-Launch-Meta-Screenshot-2560x1440-G.png", "id": "523141100328151", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031339_523141106994817_8586809118821300384_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mkdC6TqITZAQ7kNvwEnykSa&_nc_oc=AdkuqpyFU8fJYQjp7UL2-JhNcHLKB1Kh96XyNKKQrFsfqfDefrOB4mBRDesNLcJx444&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyCG8FuoSynRExhN65-Uz-4abeh5do-66IyeAMRljYbOQ&oe=69BE84F5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SA-LS-Meta-VideoCover-2560x1440.png", "id": "8770630689667401", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982555_8770630713000732_6259191283680804636_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_aid=0&_nc_ohc=mD9pt6HDwdcQ7kNvwFJzGLE&_nc_oc=AdlG95jtqTCCdQRanGob8jfbCcQ5xME7ea99_OPWEFLhqAG6_A8keHrJTDYnwHxHP0o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxbcmPZAwUYMyYCptGvrTIW9dgkMMHanxo4A02DHnl3aw&oe=69BE96A8"}, "display_name": "Last Stand", "keywords": ["pvp", "shoot", "horror", "action", "duel"], "long_description": "Step into the future of mixed reality with Last Stand, from the makers of Drop Dead: The Cabin. This is the world\u2019s first multi-location mixed reality PvP shootout. Your living room becomes a battlefield as you eliminate your opponent while fending off a relentless zombie invasion. Move, dodge, and take cover in a fully immersive combat zone.\n\n{1067517198339345}\n\n**1v1 Mixed Reality PvP Combat**\n\nBattle opponents from anywhere\u2014each player fights from their own home. Turn your living room into a battlefield, outsmarting rivals with real-world strategy.\n\n{1232934048025689}\n\n**Precision Full-Body Tracking**\n\nDodge bullets like in The Matrix or land headshots like John Wick! Our full-body tracking ensures every movement feels accurate and responsive, immersing you deeply in the action.\n\n{428700763582659}\n\n**Your Room, Your Advantage**\n\nTransform your living room from a Netflix haven into a tactical stronghold. Your couch becomes a fortress; your table, a shield. Outsmart and outmaneuver\u2014your home is part of the fight!\n\n{1127967098666563}\n\n**Cinematic Shootouts at Home**\n\nExperience intense gunfights and explosive combat, with dynamic destruction shaping every encounter. With dynamic destruction, every round is as intense as a blockbuster.\n\n**Last Stand is an early access title pushing the boundaries of mixed reality. Join our community on Discord to share feedback and help us shape the future of the game.**\n\nVisit **LastStandXR.com** to learn more and join the discord.", "short_description": "Step into the future of mixed reality with Last Stand, from the makers of Drop Dead: The Cabin. This is the world\u2019s first multi-location mixed reality PvP shootout. Your living room becomes a battlefield as you eliminate your opponent while fending off a relentless zombie invasion. Move, dodge, and take cover in a fully interactive, immersive combat zone."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://soulassembly.com/privacy-policy"